@startuml
title RAG Question Answering Sequence Diagram

actor Customer

participant Frontend
participant "FastAPI Backend" as Backend
participant "Retriever Service" as Retriever
database "FAISS Vector DB" as FAISS
participant "OpenAI Embedding" as Embedding
participant "OpenAI GPT" as LLM

Customer -> Frontend : Enter question

Frontend -> Backend : POST /ask(question)

Backend -> Retriever : Retrieve relevant documents

Retriever -> Embedding : Generate query embedding
Embedding --> Retriever : Query vector

Retriever -> FAISS : Similarity Search
FAISS --> Retriever : Top-K documents

Retriever --> Backend : Retrieved context

Backend -> LLM : Prompt(question + context)

LLM --> Backend : Generated answer

Backend --> Frontend : Response(answer)

Frontend --> Customer : Display answer

@enduml